'''Misaki Konno''' (紺野美崎) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Misaki Konno
|image = E 382.png
|appearance = [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,400¢ - 5,530¢
}}

==Enemy==
Unlike most other Power Pro enemies, Misaki does not have a debuff, but instead has very high health and attack power, but extremely short range.

==Strategy==
Misaki's main weakness is her lack of range, giving leeway to crowd-control cats to constantly keep her busy. As she is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy, you'll usually need to unlock some counters from [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Bosses]]. But if the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] is in your favor, you'll have some good units that can keep her at bay. [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Magica Cat]] is a highlight, weaking her from a respectable range and alleviating some pressure from your meatshields, while also being your most accessible counter. Use them with some damage dealers ([[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]) and she will eventually go down.

If you really want her Cat Unit, you can just use a treasure radar on the [[Warm Smile (Easy)|first stage]] of her appearances, as she is at a very unrespectable 2% magnification and can be defeated by basically any unit that is strong enough to move a small rock.

